            </note>
            <note corresp="#d688-f3" n="3" xml:id="d688-f3-content">
                <p>For documentation regarding return by the United States of military bases in the
                    Galápagos Islands to Ecuador in 1946, see <ref target="frus1946v11#pg_836">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1946, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">xi</hi>, pp. 836</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
